journey in the sciences.

00:07:44.129 --> 00:07:47.579
So you'll notice at the top of each course

00:07:47.579 --> 00:07:50.569
in the actual Khan
Academy library you'll see

00:07:50.569 --> 00:07:52.439
a call to action button that says,

00:07:52.439 --> 00:07:54.879
give a feedback here,
click here for feedback,

00:07:54.879 --> 00:07:57.299
and you can click on that
and fill out a little form

00:07:57.299 --> 00:07:59.299
about any of our new science courses.

00:07:59.299 --> 00:08:02.069
And all of that comes right to me,

00:08:02.069 --> 00:08:04.999
even right now on my second screen here,

00:08:04.999 --> 00:08:07.109
I'm looking at the latest feedback

00:08:07.109 --> 00:08:08.479
that we've gotten through this button,

00:08:08.479 --> 00:08:10.359
and you can see right there at the bottom-

00:08:10.359 --> 00:08:13.805
- Read me a little feedback,
read me a little feedback.

00:08:13.805 --> 00:08:17.926
- This is from an AP environmental
science student who says,

00:08:17.926 --> 00:08:20.159
"The questions and information is amazing.

00:08:20.159 --> 00:08:22.489
I just find the course, a little short,

